Untitled UI PRO
---------------
The browser interface this package ships is @ichava/react-icon-browser, which
includes components from Untitled UI React PRO, used under the Untitled UI
licence (https://www.untitledui.com/license). Those components are compiled
into:

- resources/vendor/react-icon-browser (the vendored library build)
- public/assets/js/inertia-app.js and public/assets/css/inertia-app.css (the
  committed browser bundle, published to host applications)

That licence does not permit exposing their source code publicly or
redistributing them as a UI kit or library. This repository must therefore
remain private, and the package may be installed only by holders of a licence
from Simtabi LLC.

Third-party components
----------------------
Third-party code in this repository stays under its own licence:

- Untitled UI React (free components, compiled into the same build): MIT
  License, Copyright (c) Untitled UI.
  https://github.com/untitleduico/react/blob/main/LICENSE
- Geist and Geist Mono fonts (public/assets/fonts and
  resources/vendor/react-icon-browser/fonts): SIL Open Font License 1.1,
  Copyright (c) Vercel. See public/assets/fonts/LICENSE.txt.
- Icon assets under resources/assets/svg keep the licence of their upstream
  icon set.
- Ichava's open-source packages this package depends on (ichava/core and the
  icon packs) are published under their own licences, unaffected by this one.
